            "title": "Exclusive-Financial software provider OneStream explores sale after share price drop, sources say",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "(Reuters) -Financial software maker OneStream is exploring strategic options including a possible sale, less than 18 months after its \u200bstock market debut, according to three people familiar with the matter.  OneStream\u00a0has been working with investment \u200cbankers at JPMorgan Chase on its options, the sources said, noting that deliberations are at an early stage and there is no \u200cguarantee of any transaction involving the company.  Private equity firms including Blackstone and Hg are among the names that\u00a0the sources said have been studying possible bids for OneStream in recent weeks.",
